# Ward (CR 702.21a) triggers when its permanent "becomes the target" of an opponent's spell, and a permanent chosen for two
# instances of "target" (CR 115.3) becomes the target of that spell once (CR 601.2c). Bot2's Kolaghan's Command destroys
# Bot1's Roaming Throne, an artifact creature with ward {2}, and also deals 2 damage to it: one ward trigger goes on the
# stack, not two. Bot2 has five mana, three for the Command and two for one ward payment, so the Command resolves and the
# Throne is destroyed. (Two triggers would ask for {2} twice and counter the Command.)

